        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    mean_1 = 8.0\n    mean_2 = 6.0\n    var_1 = 1.5\n    var_2 = 2.0\n    n1 = 18\n    n2 = 22\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    standard_error = ((var_1 / n1) + (var_2 / n2)) ** 0.5\n    t_value = (mean_1 - mean_2) / standard_error\n    answer = round(t_value, 2)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
